  <h2>Proposed Rule Amendments &amp; Adoptions</h2>
  <p>The Michigan Supreme Court publishes proposed amendments and adoptions to the Michigan Court Rules, Rules of Evidence, Michigan Rules of Professional Conduct, Rules Concerning the State Bar, Michigan Code of Judicial Conduct, and other administrative rules. Public comment is invited on all open proposals before the Court takes final action.</p>
</div>

<!-- Intro / Comment Instructions -->
<div class="intro-block">
  <div class="intro-section">
    <h3>About This Page</h3>
    <p>Each proposal below includes an ADM docket number, the action being taken (amendment or adoption), a plain-language summary, and a link to the full proposal document. Proposals are listed from newest to oldest. Once the comment period for a proposal has closed, the record is preserved here for reference.</p>
    <p style="margin-top:12px">After the comment period closes, the Court reviews all submissions before issuing a final order. Final orders are published separately in the Court's administrative orders.</p>
  </div>
  <div>
    <div class="comment-box">
      <div class="cb-label">How to Submit a Public Comment</div>
      <div class="cb-text">Comments on any open proposal must be submitted by email before the comment period expiration date. Include the ADM number, your name or organization, and your complete comment in the body of the email or as an attachment.</div>
      <a href="mailto:comments@michigancourts-rp.gov" class="cb-email">comments@michigancourts-rp.gov</a>
      <div class="cb-note">Anonymous comments are accepted. Organizations should identify themselves by their full legal name. All timely-submitted comments become part of the public record and will be displayed below.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Amendments List -->
<div class="amendments-wrap">
  <div class="section-label"><span>Open for Comment</span></div>

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       ADM 1 — Adoption of the Michigan Court Rules
       To add more amendments, copy this .adm-card block.
       ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <div class="adm-card">
    <div class="adm-card-top">
      <div class="adm-left">
        <div class="adm-meta">
          <span class="adm-number">ADM 1</span>
          <span class="adm-ruleset">Michigan Court Rules</span>
          <span class="adm-badge-open">Open for Comment</span>
        </div>
        <div class="adm-action">Adoption of the Michigan Court Rules</div>
        <div class="adm-summary">
          The Court proposes the adoption of the Michigan Court Rules in their entirety, establishing the foundational procedural framework governing practice and procedure in all courts within the Michigan judicial system. This adoption sets uniform standards for pleading, motion practice, discovery, trials, and appeals.
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="adm-right">
        <div class="adm-dates">
          <div class="adm-date-row">
            <div class="dk">Issued</div>
            <div class="dv">June 1, 2026</div>
          </div>
          <div class="adm-date-row">
            <div class="dk">Comment Period Expires</div>
            <div class="dv">June 30, 2026</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- Replace href="#" with the real Google Drive PDF link -->
        <a href="#" class="adm-proposal-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M4 4h8l4 4v8H4V4z"/><path d="M12 4v4h4"/><path d="M7 11h6M7 14h4"/></svg>
          View Proposal (PDF)
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Comments Toggle -->
    <div class="adm-toggle-row" onclick="toggleComments('adm1-comments', this)">
      <span class="toggle-label">
        Public Comments
        <span class="comment-count">0 comments</span>
      </span>
      <span class="toggle-arrow" id="adm1-arrow">▼</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Comments Panel -->
    <div class="adm-comments" id="adm1-comments">
      <div class="comments-inner">
        <div class="no-comments">No comments have been submitted yet. Be the first — email your comment to <a href="mailto:comments@michigancourts-rp.gov" style="color:#1a4a7a">comments@michigancourts-rp.gov</a>.</div>

